	(text "CTRL low = RX; high = TX. PA11 supplies switch.\nReset/sleep: both controls low; no RF until powered.\nWake: supply high, wait >=20us, select path; wait >=100us.\nStop RF before switching. CTRL low before supply low.\nR610 opens the antenna path for conducted testing."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
